    "title": "MyScoutee event-payment-cancellations",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Typed calls to the existing EventPaymentCancellations owner. Native validation, queries, state transitions and scheduler behavior retained. REAL/DEMO and explicit job scope; no-store. 2 MiB request / 8 MiB response bounds; no automatic retries. Cancellation snapshots expose only eight routing/actor fields. Refund and authorization/gateway fields stay at payments."
